Third-party work
----------------

This repository contains no game content. It requires your own legally
obtained copy of BattleBlock Theater (Xbox 360 XBLA).

Portions of this project are derived from, and build upon, the following
works, each under its own licence:

  * The Simpsons Game Recompiled — YesterMester
    https://github.com/YesterMester/TheSimpsonsGameRecomp  (GPL-3.0)
    ReXGlue runtime, launcher and project layout used as the base.

  * the-simpsons-game-nx — R-drg
    https://github.com/R-drg/the-simpsons-game-nx  (GPL-3.0)
    Nintendo Switch port design, entry point, CMake layout and SD release
    structure followed by this project.

  * project8-sw — R-drg
    https://github.com/R-drg/project8-sw  (GPL-3.0)
    Switch port patterns for frame pacing, input and release packaging.

  * 360tools — sp00nz
    https://github.com/sp00nznet/360tools  (GPL-3.0)
    Recompilation toolkit used for binary analysis and triage.

  * ReXGlue SDK — rexglue
    https://github.com/rexglue/rexglue-sdk  (MIT)
    Static recompiler toolchain (rexglue codegen) and runtime.

  * Mesa (mesa-switch) — danfromtico / The Behemoth community
    https://github.com/danfromtico/mesa-switch  (MIT)
    Vulkan driver for the Switch, patched via patches/mesa-switch/.

  * devkitPro — devkitPro
    https://devkitpro.org/  (various)
    Switch toolchain (devkitA64, libnx) and portlibs.

Licence texts for the shipped dependencies are collected in LICENSES/.
The patches under patches/ are ports of upstream changes and keep their
original licences and authorship.

